[{"answer":"Good morning, Kenton Festival box office. How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm coming to Kenton for a few days' holiday next month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and a friend told me there's a festival.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/4.mp3"},{"answer":"She gave me this number to find out about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/5.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, the festival begins on the 16th of May and goes on till the 19th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be there from the 15th till the 19th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So could you tell me the programme, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, on the first day, there's the opening ceremony, in the town centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/10.mp3"},{"answer":"People start gathering around 2 o'clock, to get a good place to see from,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and the events will start at 2.45, and finish about 5.30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/12.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, thanks. I'll make sure I get there early to get a good spot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The festival will be officially opened by the mayor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/14.mp3"},{"answer":"He'll just speak for a few minutes, welcoming everyone to the festival.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/15.mp3"},{"answer":"All the town councillors will be there, and of course lots of other people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there'll be a performance by a band.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Most years we have a children's choir,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/19.mp3"},{"answer":"but this year the local army cadets offered to perform,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're very good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/21.mp3"},{"answer":"After that, a community group from the town will perform a play they've written themselves, just a short one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/22.mp3"},{"answer":"It's about Helen Tungate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know if you've heard of her?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I certainly have.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/25.mp3"},{"answer":"She was a scientist years ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/26.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/27.mp3"},{"answer":"She was born in Kenton exactly 100 years ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/28.mp3"},{"answer":"so we're celebrating her centenary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm a biologist, so I've always been interested in her,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't realise she came from Kenton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, all that will take place in the afternoon,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and later, as the sun sets, there'll be a firework display.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/34.mp3"},{"answer":"You should go to the park to watch, as you'll get the best view from there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and the display takes place on the opposite side of the river.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/36.mp3"},{"answer":"It's always one of the most popular events in the festival.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/38.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's happening on the other days?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/39.mp3"},{"answer":"There are several events that go on the whole time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/40.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, the students of the art college have produced a number of videos,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/41.mp3"},{"answer":"all connected with relationships between children and their grandparents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/42.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/43.mp3"},{"answer":"It makes a change from children and parents, doesn't it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Because the art college is in use for classes, throughout the festival,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/46.mp3"},{"answer":"the videos are being shown in Handsworth House.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/47.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you spell the name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/48.mp3"},{"answer":"H-A-N-D-S-W-O-R-T-H.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Handsworth House.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's close to the Town Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Now let me see, what else can I tell you about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Are there any displays of ballet dancing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm particularly interested in that as I do it as a hobby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/55.mp3"},{"answer":"There isn't any ballet, I'm afraid,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/56.mp3"},{"answer":"but there'll be a demonstration of traditional dances from all round the country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that'd be nice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Where's that being held?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It's in the market in the town centre - the outdoor one, not the covered market.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And it's on at 2 and 5 every afternoon of the festival, apart from the first day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm interested in all kinds of dancing, so I'm sure I'll enjoy that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you will.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And I'd really like to go to some concerts, if there are any.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there are several.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Three performed by professionals, and one by local children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/67.mp3"},{"answer":"And where is it being held?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/68.mp3"},{"answer":"It's in the library, which is in Part Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/69.mp3"},{"answer":"On the 18th, at 6.30 in the evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I presume I'll need tickets for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you can book online,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/72.mp3"},{"answer":"or you can buy them when you arrive in Kenton,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/73.mp3"},{"answer":"either at the festival box office, or from any shops displaying our logo in the windows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think that'll keep me busy for the whole of my stay in Kenton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you so much for all your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/76.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome. I hope you enjoy your stay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you. Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-2-part-1-2023-04-28-15-34-45/78.mp3"}]
